# Large binary game assets that do not contribute code relationships
#
# NOTE on bracket escaping: graphify's ignore matcher uses Python's fnmatch,
# not git's glob engine. Backslash escaping (\[mlo\], as used in .gitignore
# for git itself) does NOT escape brackets under fnmatch - it is inert and
# matches nothing. The correct fnmatch escape for a literal bracket is the
# single-char class trick: [[] matches a literal '[', []] matches a literal
# ']'. Verified empirically against fnmatch.fnmatch() and against graphify's
# own _is_ignored()/_load_graphifyignore() before committing this file.
resources/[[]mlo[]]/
resources/[[]clothes[]]/
**/stream/
*.ydr
*.ybn
*.ymap
*.ytyp
*.ytd
*.ydd
*.ymf
*.gfx

